    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d433">

                <pb facs="0770" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg666"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador to the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        President’s Special Assistant</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hopkins</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d433-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tehran</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-12-03">December 3, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Molotov left here yesterday morning. I am therefore sending him message through
                    Soviet Embassy here containing information in your <pb facs="0771" n="667"
                        xml:id="pg667"/> cable to me<anchor n="2" xml:id="d433-f2"/> but as time is
                    so short believe you should also have appropriate person in Algiers inform
                    Vyshinsky and offer him air transportation to Cairo. Molotov stated in Tehran
                    that he would designate Vyshinsky to represent the Soviet Government at the
                        conference.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d433-f3"/> I have advised Molotov of the
                    probability of your placing plane at Vyshinsky disposal in Algiers in the event
                    he still desires him to attend conference.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d433-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d433-f1-content">
